  "plot_summary": "There were few formal announcements made this month, mainly confined (as usual) to the letters pages of <i>Fantastic Four</i> and <i>Amazing Spider-Man</i>.\n\nBut there were no shortage of full-page promotional ads hyping the new Giant-Man in <i>Tales to Astonish</i> and especially the Human Torch/Captain America clash in this month's <i>Strange Tales</i> (not surprising).",
